},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Allari the Souleater says: The strength of the ren'dorei against the void...",
["timestamp"] = 1771505865,
["id"] = "s0_1057",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Allari the Souleater",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Allari the Souleater says: Impressive, Leona. You broke that creature's hold on Kvotheen with ease.",
["timestamp"] = 1771505870,
["id"] = "s0_1058",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Leona Darkstrider",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Leona Darkstrider says: The ren'dorei hear the Void's whispers at all times. We are adept at silencing them.",
["timestamp"] = 1771505874,
["id"] = "s0_1059",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Allari the Souleater",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Allari the Souleater says: I see. Let us return to Umbric. There is much for us to discuss.",
["timestamp"] = 1771505879,
["id"] = "s0_1060",
},
{
