["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "You loot 1 Gold, 12 Silver, 11 Copper (+2 Silver, 23 Copper)",
["id"] = "s0_1155",
["timestamp"] = 1771526256,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Garrulous Gladiator",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Garrulous Gladiator says: Come now. Where's your ambition?",
["id"] = "s0_1156",
["timestamp"] = 1771526259,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Grand Magister Rommath",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Grand Magister Rommath says: So the Twilight's Blade are indeed recruiting here. I suppose I have to work with Umbric after all.",
["id"] = "s0_1157",
["timestamp"] = 1771526267,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Grand Magister Rommath",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Grand Magister Rommath says: It's imperative that we stop the Twilight's Blade at its source: The Twilight Highlands.",
["id"] = "s0_1158",
["timestamp"] = 1771526293,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Grand Magister Rommath",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Grand Magister Rommath says: This portal will take you to our base of operations. I'll meet you there.",
["id"] = "s0_1159",
["timestamp"] = 1771526299,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Grand Magister Rommath",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Grand Magister Rommath says: Yet more minds twisted by the Void. This must seem quite familiar to you, Umbric.",
["id"] = "s0_1160",
["timestamp"] = 1771526304,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ray of Putrescence",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Ray of Putrescence's ritual has been interrupted! Finish it!",
["id"] = "s0_1161",
["timestamp"] = 1771526311,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Grand Magister Rommath",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Grand Magister Rommath says: Infiltrate the cult and see what you can learn. But do not succumb to the allure of their sermons.",
["id"] = "s0_1162",
["timestamp"] = 1771526324,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Umbric",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Magister Umbric says: A strong enough will can resist the call of Void, Rommath. You would do well to remember that.",
["id"] = "s0_1163",
["timestamp"] = 1771526331,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Grand Magister Rommath",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Grand Magister Rommath says: We may have removed the cult's presence from Orgrimmar and Stormwind, but their numbers still grow. This is a staging ground.",
["id"] = "s0_1164",
["timestamp"] = 1771526335,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Umbric",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Magister Umbric says: Arator told me of a larger force being assembled by Xal'atath. The Twilight's Blade seems a lesser threat by comparison.",
["id"] = "s0_1165",
["timestamp"] = 1771526343,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Grand Magister Rommath",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Grand Magister Rommath says: Every practitioner of void magic is a threat, Umbric. Have your own mistakes and misadventures done nothing to teach you that?",
["id"] = "s0_1166",
["timestamp"] = 1771526353,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Umbric",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Magister Umbric says: Becoming ren'dorei has proven to me the opposite. The Void can be harnessed for good, and its wielders left in control of their minds.",
["id"] = "s0_1167",
["timestamp"] = 1771526361,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Umbric",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Magister Umbric says: If you want to speak of \"mistakes,\" look to your own Magisters. How many times has their pursuit of power nearly led to ruin?",
["id"] = "s0_1168",
["timestamp"] = 1771526372,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Grand Magister Rommath",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Grand Magister Rommath says: I will not be lectured by you! Not when you forced me to exile you from Silvermoon for refusing to abandon your forbidden research!",
["id"] = "s0_1169",
["timestamp"] = 1771526380,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Umbric",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Magister Umbric says: The knowledge gleaned from that research has saved our world countless times! You're merely too stubborn to acknowledge it!",
["id"] = "s0_1170",
["timestamp"] = 1771526389,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Grand Magister Rommath",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Grand Magister Rommath says: Enough! Like everything else you do, this plan to infiltrate the cult is foolhardy and dangerous. It had better work, Umbric.",
["id"] = "s0_1171",
["timestamp"] = 1771526400,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Umbric",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Magister Umbric says: Oh it will, Rommath. The question is whether or not you'll admit it when it does.",
["id"] = "s0_1172",
["timestamp"] = 1771526407,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ix the Bloodfallen",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "The Twilight's Blade have begun summoning more forces. Defeat their ritual leaders!",
["id"] = "s0_1173",
["timestamp"] = 1771526472,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONEY",
