},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Gehl Harrowtongue says: Take heed of Mor'duun's speech. Our leader's words have set many cultists' hearts afire. I'm sure they will yours as well.",
